# Project environment for run-positron.sh, CI and agents. Goes in the root of the project repository.
#
# ENV_IMAGE is the image with R and packages that the project runs on. Always a specific tag (not latest),
# so the project opens a year from now with the same versions of R and packages.
#   shared image:        ghcr.io/<owner>/r-env:<tag>          (tags: GitHub -> Packages -> r-env)
#   own project image:   ghcr.io/<owner>/<project>-env:<tag>  (if the project has a Dockerfile, see README)
# Updating the environment = changing the tag here in a separate commit.
ENV_IMAGE=ghcr.io/fnkc-stats/r-env:YYYY.MM.DD-abc1234
